Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `v`
  --> user_struct_named_noclone_is_still_cloneable.jet:12:9
    |
 12 |     eat(v)
    |         ^
 Why: `eat` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^v`) to move it — this is `v`'s last use — or the copy marker `~` (`~v`) to keep a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
